<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Certificate Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">中国国家强制性产品认证证书</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 5px;">证书编号: <span data-field="certificate_number">{{ certificate_number }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">委托人名称、地址</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">ABB France</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">2 rue d'Arsonval 69680 Chassieu France</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">生产商（制造商）名称、地址</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">ABB France</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">2 rue d'Arsonval 69680 Chassieu France</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">生产企业名称、地址</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">ABB Bulgaria EOOD - Rakovski branch</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">BULGARIA, 4142 Village of Stryama, Region of Plovdiv, Municipality of Rakovski, Rakovski Industrial Zone, 14 Industrial Road 1, nr.14-18</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">产品名称和系列、规格、型号</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">切换电容接线器</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">产品标准和技术要求</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">GB/T 14048.4-2010</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">上述产品符合强制性产品认证实施规则 CNCA-C03-02:2014 的要求，特此认证。</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">发证日期: <span data-field="issue_date">{{ issue_date }}</span> 有效期至: <span data-field="expiry_date">{{ expiry_date }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">证书有效期内本证书的有效性依据接受认证机构的定期监督审核保持。本证书为变更证书，证书首次颁发日期: <span data-field="first_issue_date">{{ first_issue_date }}</span> 本证书的相关信息可通过国家认证网站 www.cnca.gov.cn 查询。中国合格评定国家认可委员会 CNAS C001-P</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-right: 40px;">
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">主任:</p>
      <p style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">{{ director_name }}</p>
    </div>
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-left: 40px;">
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">中国质量认证中心</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">http://www.cqc.com.cn</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">中国 • 北京 • 南四环西路188号9区 100070</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">电话: +86 10 83886666</p>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: left; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
    Q <span data-field="certificate_number_footer">{{ certificate_number_footer }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">CERTIFICATE FOR CHINA COMPULSORY PRODUCT CERTIFICATION</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 5px;">CERTIFICATE NO.: <span data-field="certificate_number_en">{{ certificate_number_en }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">NAME AND ADDRESS OF THE APPLICANT</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">ABB France</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">2 rue d'Arsonval 69680 Chassieu France</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">NAME AND ADDRESS OF THE MANUFACTURER</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">ABB France</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">2 rue d'Arsonval 69680 Chassieu France</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">NAME AND ADDRESS OF THE FACTORY</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">ABB Bulgaria EOOD - Rakovski branch</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">BULGARIA, 4142 Village of Stryama, Region of Plovdiv, Municipality of Rakovski, Rakovski Industrial Zone, 14 Industrial Road 1, nr.14-18</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">PRODUCT NAME, MODEL AND SPECIFICATION</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">Contactors for capacitor switching</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">UA16: Uimp: 8kV; Uc: 1000V; Ith: 30A; Utilization Category: AC-B; Ueb: 220-240V/7.5kV,400-415V/12.5kV; 4.4kV/13.7kV,500-550V/15.5kV,680V/21.5kV; Ia: Uas: 24V/50Hz,110V/50Hz,110V/60Hz; 60Hz-220V/50Hz-230V/60Hz,380-400V/50Hz-400V/60Hz; IP20; Poles: 3P; Attached: Auxiliary Contacts: 1hA; AC-15:Ue/le:24-127V/8,220-240V/380-440V/50-60Hz/2VA; DC-13: Ue/le:24V/6A, 4.8V/2/A,72V/110-125V/50-60Hz,250-220V/0.3A; 1NC</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">THE STANDARDS AND TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR THE PRODUCTS</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0;">GB/T 14048.4-2010</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">This is to certify that the above mentioned products comply with requirements of implementation rules for compulsory certification (REFNO.CNCA-C03-02:2014).</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Valid from: <span data-field="valid_from_date">{{ valid_from_date }}</span> Valid until: <span data-field="valid_until_date">{{ valid_until_date }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The validity of the certificate is subject to positive result of the regular follow up inspection by issuing certification body until the expiry date.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Date of original issued: <span data-field="original_issue_date">{{ original_issue_date }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The certificate information is available through CNCA's website: www.cnca.gov.cn Accredited by China National Accreditation Service for Conformity Assessment CNAS C001-P</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-right: 40px;">
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">President:</p>
      <p style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">{{ president_name }}</p>
    </div>
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-left: 40px;">
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">CHINA QUALITY CERTIFICATION CENTRE</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">http://www.cqc.com.cn</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Section 9, No. 188, Nanshuaiuan Xilu, Beijing 100070 P. R. China</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Tel: +86 10 83886666</p>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: left; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
    Q <span data-field="certificate_number_footer_en">{{ certificate_number_footer_en }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">附件</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 5px;">证书编号: <span data-field="certificate_number_attachment">{{ certificate_number_attachment }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 5px;">第 1 页 共 1 页</p>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 5px;">纸号: <span data-field="paper_number">{{ paper_number }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">型号解释:</h2>
    <table style="width: 50%;">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;">UA</td>
          <td style="width: 10%;">16</td>
          <td style="width: 10%;">30</td>
          <td style="width: 10%;">10</td>
          <td style="width: 10%;">V</td>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>I - Main designation:</td>
          <td>UA</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>II - Range size</td>
          <td>16</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>III - Main Pole Construction</td>
          <td>30 - 3 Normally Opened and 0 Normally Closed main poles.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>IV - Auxiliary Pole Construction</td>
          <td>10 - One Normally opened auxiliary pole provided.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>V - Coil code</td>
          <td>See table 1</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">注: 此附录与证书同时使用时有效。</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-right: 40px;">
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">主任:</p>
      <p style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">{{ director_name_attachment }}</p>
    </div>
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-left: 40px;">
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">中国质量认证中心</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">http://www.cqc.com.cn</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">中国 • 北京 • 南四环西路188号9区 100070</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">电话: +86 10 83886666</p>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: left; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
    Q <span data-field="certificate_number_attachment_footer">{{ certificate_number_attachment_footer }}</span>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>